    "dac594f5-6f42-441b-b718-a5640c6f4896": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16688272900316__dac594f5-6f42-441b-b718-a5640c6f4896-16672924418c53fb80-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>An electrolyte powder mix.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WVTPrj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is in Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Best Hydrate contains a blend of electrolytes, and natural flavors to support optimal hydration and recovery.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_maGdDP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I use Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Mix one serving of Best Hydrate with water and consume before, during, or after physical activity for best results.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nFVFB9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Best Hydrate suitable for everyone?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Best Hydrate is formulated for athletes, fitness enthusiasts, and anyone looking to stay hydrated, but consult a healthcare provider if you have specific health concerns.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TWRaPi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any allergens in Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Best Hydrate is free from common allergens such as gluten, dairy, and nuts.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_86y8eh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many servings are in a container of Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Each container of Best Hydrate contains 30 servings.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TidkF6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will there be more flavors?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, while our current formula serves as a comprehensive, all-around hydration solution, this is just the beginning! Keep an eye out for upcoming flavors!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UBwcxm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why is there glucose?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Now, don’t be fooled by “zero-sugar” claims! Proper hydration, requires the right balance of glucose to drive optimal absorption of water in the cells. Our formula keeps sugar content low—about 1\/10th of what’s found in typical sports drinks—without compromising effectiveness.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TNjKmT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is ORS?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Oral Rehydration Solution is a simple solution used to prevent and treat dehydration. ORS contains a precise balance of electrolytes and carbohydrates mixed with water.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_97meAW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use Best Hydrate daily?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Best Hydrate can be used daily to help maintain hydration levels, especially during exercise or hot weather.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yhFdnj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is there a subscription option for Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Coming soon!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NAkqt7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I purchase Best Hydrate?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Best Hydrate is available on our official website and Amazon.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16688272900316__dac594f5-6f42-441b-b718-a5640c6f4896-16672924418c53fb80-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to take Best Hydrate Electrolyte Mix",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Dosage: Put one scoop into 500mL\/16oz of drinking water (or two scoops into one liter\/32oz)<\/li><li>Let dissolve - Shake or Stir (~20 seconds)<\/li><li>Drink one liter\/32oz per day for BEST results<\/li><li>Discard unused solution after 12 hrs., or 48 hrs. if refrigerated<\/li><li>Do not mix Best Hydrate with soft drinks, sports drinks, or fruit juices<\/li><li>See peel-back label for more details.<\/li><\/ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16688272900316__dac594f5-6f42-441b-b718-a5640c6f4896-16672924418c53fb80-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the Formula?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>A precise blend of electrolytes and nutrients to optimally hydrate you.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16688272900316__dac594f5-6f42-441b-b718-a5640c6f4896-16672924418c53fb80-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does it help?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>It's meant to help you replenish fluids, electrolytes, and vital nutrients regularly lost daily or from physical activity, illness, or travel.<\/p><p>Our science-backed formula is designed to promote optimal hydration and ensures you stay energized and hydrated throughout the day.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "a28c49d0-90ca-483f-bf46-d4bee34fac3b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When do I use it?",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<p>Daily, as needed to rehydrate, as per the label<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
